---
alwaysApply: true
---

- your coding shall follow Object-oriented programming the most possible
- codebase shall be ready for translation. (babel)
- you shall never apply migrations yourself. However, you are authorized to add or edit a new migration file into alembic/version directory.
- database interaction code shall be in dao directory.
- if you need to create new reusable modules, place them in the lib directory. Most of the codebase shall be there.
- css, javascript an other statics shall be in static directory